## 4. Fix: View Allocations — `Modify` Button Not Working

**Root cause:** `jumpToEqcForBatch()` calls `showSection('equipment-inv', ...)` which does not exist. The correct section name is `'equip-cycle'` and the correct nav element is `#nav-equip-cycle`.

**Fix:**
```js
function jumpToEqcForBatch(reservationId) {
  // 1. Navigate to Equipment Cycle section
  showSection('equip-cycle', document.getElementById('nav-equip-cycle'));
  setTimeout(() => {
    // 2. Select the correct reservation in the dropdown
    const dropdown = document.getElementById('eqc-reservation-select');
    if (dropdown && reservationId) {
      const opt = Array.from(dropdown.options).find(o =>
        o.value === reservationId ||
        o.text.toLowerCase().includes(String(reservationId).toLowerCase())
      );
      if (opt) { dropdown.value = opt.value; dropdown.dispatchEvent(new Event('change')); }
    }
    // 3. Scroll to Deployment Manifest panel
    setTimeout(() => {
      document.getElementById('alloc-manifest-panel')?.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'start' });
    }, 500);
  }, 350);
}
```

**Files:** `admin.js` (`jumpToEqcForBatch`)

